  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Configuration Issues**\n\nI\'ve been examining the configuration files, specifically `vite.config.ts` and `package.json`, and it seems the build steps like `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` completed successfully. This suggests the issue isn\'t related to those processes, so it must be a runtime error or something with the dev server. I\'m focusing on the `vite.config.ts` file, particularly the `find` configuration related to `three-real`.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "sTb_atb9FYjaxs0PjZjssQI"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7182742333787711145"
